        "TileImage": "$($repository 252428ca-3f8e-4477-b2b9-58f18cff3e44).Image",
        "Description": "Good morning 47.\rThis time, the targets are criminals hiding out in the nightclubs of Berlin. They are murderers with the rage of beasts, and their escape leads them to Club Hölle on the outskirts of Berlin.\rOur client is demanding the elimination of all of them.\rThey are cautious and very violent men. Therefore, the client demanded the best agent.\rHunt the ferocious beasts like the apex predator.\rGood Hunting.",
